  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nareng&apos;ewoi BMU Livelihoods Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Fishing. , Town/City: Nareng&apos;ewoi Village, Turkana County, Summary: The project funds will be used to provide the BMU with support for administrative costs, capacity building and purchasing fishing equipment and gear. Funding will be used to conduct a market study, develop a business plan, training the group on value addition to their products, marketing, GOK fishing regulations and sustainable fishing requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
